        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've probably been there - the holiday family dinner that slowly chips away at your sanity. That kind of awful-but-nostalgic experience, you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a masochistic trip down memory lane and relive all the awkward moments and infuriating relatives in <i>Family Dinner</i>. In this narrative-driven experience, you'll actually get to resolve those unresolved family dramas at the dinner table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't take too long! Complete all your missions and escape before your social battery runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hot-and-cold disaster of a college sister</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big bro, aka Mama's boy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inappropriate uncle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother's theatrics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: ~20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Compatibility:</strong> Family Dinner is playable on the Steam Deck. To play, you'll need to remap the &quot;Enter&quot; key to a controller button through Steam's controller configuration. We're working on native controller support in a future update, but the game is fully functional with this simple setup.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've probably been there - the holiday family dinner that slowly chips away at your sanity. That kind of awful-but-nostalgic experience, you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a masochistic trip down memory lane and relive all the awkward moments and infuriating relatives in <i>Family Dinner</i>. In this narrative-driven experience, you'll actually get to resolve those unresolved family dramas at the dinner table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't take too long! Complete all your missions and escape before your social battery runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hot-and-cold disaster of a college sister</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big bro, aka Mama's boy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inappropriate uncle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother's theatrics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: ~20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Compatibility:</strong> Family Dinner is playable on the Steam Deck. To play, you'll need to remap the &quot;Enter&quot; key to a controller button through Steam's controller configuration. We're working on native controller support in a future update, but the game is fully functional with this simple setup.</p>",
        "short_description": "Escape the Family Dinner—a short, third-person exploration experience inspired by our traumatic &amp; nostalgic memories.",
